                    null,
                    "Fans of the show are accustomed to its storytelling techniques, with sharp cuts between scenes, dueling storylines, flashbacks and references like Burt Reynolds and Bartleby the Scrivener. In an attempt to better see that structure, we've used data analysis and data visualization of the captioning of the shows."
